    "notes": "Physical facility = 12 holes (former 18-hole course + par-3 course of Flevo Golf Resort closed end 2020; 9 holes reopened 2023, 12 holes since Jan 2024). 'Golfpark Lelystad' (52.52973, 5.45372) is the same Flevo Golf Resort site/street name, not a separate course. Groen loop = holes 1-6 + B10-B12 played twice (SI 1-9 odd, 10-18 even). CR/slope from official WHS course-handicap tables (18h tables 13-06-2024, 12h 04-07-2024); for the 12-hole loop the tables state CR on an 18-hole-equivalent basis with PAR=70 (scorecard par 47). course_type '12-holes' is outside the schema enum (no matching value). Only one SI per hole (no separate women's SI). Course since Dec 2025 owned by Stichting Golfbaan Lelystad."
